<title>USA: CCC buys 8,000 tonnes U.S. SRW wheat for Jamaica.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 8,000 tonnes U.S. SRW wheat for Jamaica.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corporation bought 8,000 tonnes U.S. soft red winter wheat under the export donation program to Jamaica.</p>
<p>The wheat was bought from Cargill at $175.83 a tonne slated for October 5-30 delivery.</p>
<p>The CCC is part of the U.S. Department of Agriculture.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
